# Copy to .env for local development. .env is git-ignored (SEC-001).
# No MT5 credentials are needed for the read-only probe and capture: the
# terminal must already be logged in, and the adapter attaches to it.

# Optional: explicit MT5 terminal path if multiple installations exist.
# MT5_TERMINAL_PATH=

# The account allowlist lives in config/accounts.yaml (EXEC-060, SEC-030).
